# Data / Resources

Applies to `data/` (including `data/skills/`).

## Ownership

- `Resource` scripts: `ItemData`, `SkillResource`, `ClasseData`
- Static `.tres` skill definitions under `data/skills/<class>/`
- Progression curves and schemas (`WorldProgress`, `SkillTreeDefinition` catalogs)

## Must NOT

- `extends Node` or scene references
- Autoload singletons
- Direct UI strings without i18n keys (prefer `name_key` / `description_key` for new content)
- Side effects on load (no file I/O in `_init`)

## Resource conventions

- `@export` fields for designer-editable data
- `class_name` on all reusable resources
- Skill files: `NN_slug.tres`, passive prefix `pNN_`
- Icon paths: `res://sprites/ui/skills/<class>/<skill_id>.png`

## Catalog registration

- Skills: auto-loaded from folder by `HeroEquipment`
- Items: templates in `ItemDatabase._popular_catalogo()` (moving to `.tres` templates later)

